# Boss HUD frame (#543): 224x26, a plate of the boss's blackened iron (art/objects/enemy/boss.grid) in a 1 px bone rim (the boss's horns, `o`, so the plate shows over a dark sky and over the tree band alike), a riveted rim, a brace between segment pairs, mulberry end gems and a bone-horn crest with an ember eye at the top centre. The well (x 10..213, y 4..21) is the opaque backing the 12 segments sit in (BossHud: x 12 + 17 i, y 5).
